                    insight_approved:       `Credit approved on a risk-adjusted basis: you converted the sponsor's €17.5M into a defensible €14.2M underwriting EBITDA, saw the true 3.2× leverage, priced above the hurdle so RAROC clears expected loss and capital, built a real maintenance-covenant package, and kept the book inside its limit. That is underwriting — lending the risk you can price, on terms you can defend.`,
                    insight_adjebitda:      `You underwrote to the sponsor's adjusted EBITDA: accepting €3.3M of unsigned add-backs silently raised true leverage from 3.2× to a comfortable-looking 2.6× and made every downstream number — PD, price, covenant headroom — too optimistic. Earnings quality precedes everything, and this run never recovered it.`,
